<title>USA: Countrywide Cap I sets $300 mln trust preferreds.</title>
<headline>Countrywide Cap I sets $300 mln trust preferreds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of trust preferred securities from Countrywide Credit Industries Inc affiliate Countrywide Capital I was priced on Wednesday, according to sole manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER COUNTRYWIDE CAPITAL I</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	   COUPON 8.00 PCT   MATURITY 12/15/2026</p>
<p>TYPE TRUST PREFERRED ISS PRICE 99.136  FIRST PAY DATE NA</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3	YIELD 8.077 PCT   PAY FREQ NA</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS     SPREAD 145 BP     CALLABLE NON CALL 10</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
